#
# The Linux desktop `ob bench --desktop` measures Dukovo's beside (ADR
# 0724): labwc 0.7.1 on wlroots 0.17.1, with what they load, from the
# release pocket of Ubuntu 24.04, whose packages do not change.
#
# One package a line: the SHA-256 of its file as the archive's index
# gives it (dists/noble/<component>/binary-amd64/Packages), the file's
# place in the archive, and the files and folders taken from it, each
# by its path in the package. Nothing is installed: a taken file is
# copied as it is, and a link as the file it leads to.
#
# To move to another release, change every line together: a library
# is named here because another on the list loads it.

